sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Instance A
    participant B as Instance B
    participant P as PgBouncer (transaction mode)
    participant S1 as Backend 1234

    A->>P: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    P->>S1: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    S1-->>A: true (Backend 1234 holds lock 42)
    Note over P,S1: Backend 1234 goes back to the pool, still holding lock 42
    B->>P: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    P->>S1: SELECT pg_try_advisory_lock(42)
    Note over S1: Same session asks again, re-entrancy
    S1-->>B: true
    Note over A,B: Both instances are the leader
